        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-SQPULL24-613, Square 24 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Ladder Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 24 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Square Ladder Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. Just make sure you order 2 pulls if you choose the back-to-back option. This 2 foot door pull has a 14-3/8 inch center to center. The oil rubbed bronze finish is rich and chocolatey which makes it beautiful enough for use in any home, but since it is made out of stainless steel tubing, it is tough enough for use in commercial settings too.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-SQPULL24-specifications.gif?v=1704354526\" width=\"485\" height=\"165\" boarder=\"0\" alt=\"DWDSQULL24-613 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in <a href=\"/products/24-inch-matte-black-square-ladder-pull-dwd-sqpull24-622\"><b>Matte Black Finish</b></a> and\r\n<br>\r\nOther Lengths \r\n<a href=\"/products/3-foot-oil-rubbed-bronze-square-door-pull-dwd-sqpull36-613\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a> or \r\n<a href=\"/products/oil-rubbed-bronze-3-foot-center-to-center-square-door-pull-dwd-sqpull48-613\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD SQULL24-613 Contemporary Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li> \r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 24\" (610 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 14-3/8\" (365 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\" (80 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-3/16\" (32 mm) Square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant Door Hardware</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "24 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Square Ladder Pull, DWD-SQPULL24-613",
                "description": "2 Foot Oil Rubbed Bronze Square Ladder Pull - The 24 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Square Ladder Pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. Just make sure you order 2 pulls if you choose the back-to-back option. This 2 foot door pull has a 14-3/8 inch center to center. The oil rubbed bronze finish is rich and chocolatey which makes it beautiful enough for use in any home, but since it is made out of stainless steel tubing, it is tough enough for use in commercial settings too.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Modern 24 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Square Door Pulls, 24 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Square Ladder Pulls, DWD-SQPULL24-613,  Oil Rubbed Bronze 24 Inch Ladder Pulls, 24 Inch Contemporary Stainless Door Pulls, 24 inch commercial door pulls, storefront door pulls, storefront stainless door pulls, stainless storefront door pulls, 2 foot door pulls, Contemporary Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pulls, 24 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Ladder door Pulls, Square 24 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Ladder Pulls, sig405,"
